in this directory :
	For Archlinux use PKGBUILD file as base
	
	For others
		cd where_you_have_decompressed/gxinterface/dx7interface
		regenerate/configure by :
			./autogen.sh ( --prefix=/usr for debian/ubuntu users )
			( --libdir= is specify in the configure ac ) :
		compilation :
			make 
		you can start gxinterface and click the add module to start dx7interface
		or you can starts a module as standalone directly
			gxinterface -m /path/to/the/module.file		(module can be .la .so .lo)
		change the ui
			gxinterface -i /path/to/the/ui.file 		(ui can be .ui or .xml )
		ui file for interface must contain a Gtk::Window named "window_main"
		ui file for module must contain a Gtk::Box name "box_main"
		installation ( or use checkinstall to make a .deb ) :
			sudo make install 
		or 
			sudo checkinstall -D --fstrans=no --install=yes --pkgversion="X.X.X" -y

	
	
